        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The captain summons one Swarm of Insects in an unoccupied space it can see within 5 feet. The swarm takes its turn immediately after the captain on the same Initiative count, and it obeys the captain. A swarm disappears after 1 minute, if it's reduced to 0 Hit Points, or if it's ever more than 300 feet away from the captain.</p>",
